    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Remake of the End of the Greatest RPG of All Time&quot; (TRotEotGRPGoAT for short) is the last hour of a lost (nonexistent) JRPG, &quot;remade\u201d in 3D pixel art complete with director\u2019s commentary, the digital manual, and archival footage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fully featured RPG Battle System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex deduction puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 3D/pixel hybrid visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery at the core</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/7cbea5db1d65576f2edf5c699b6cb43e.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Remake of the End of the Greatest RPG of All Time&quot; (TRotEotGRPGoAT for short) is the last hour of a lost (nonexistent) JRPG, &quot;remade\u201d in 3D pixel art complete with director\u2019s commentary, the digital manual, and archival footage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/14a5680ce3387084cddc9fc36c9718a7.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fully featured RPG Battle System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex deduction puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 3D/pixel hybrid visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery at the core</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.poster.avif?t=1745630076\" width=464 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.webm?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809660/extras/1dc30afd5a8adca87eddbd9fabf3bc62.mp4?t=1745630076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;The Remake of the End of the Greatest RPG of All Time&quot; (TRotEotGRPGoAT for short) is the last hour of a lost (nonexistent) JRPG, &quot;remade\u201d with director\u2019s commentary, the digital manual, and archival footage. It's a deduction puzzle game made from a JRPG that holds a dark secret.",
